OL,3,ABurnham responds to BBC question over
OL,4,ALabour's links to Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,7,FRussell Brand has rightly been held to
OL,8,Faccount for his "horrific" crimes and
OL,9,Fsought to explain Labour's previous
OL,10,Fassociation with the comedian.
OL,12,FSome within the Labour Party attempted
OL,13,Fto court Brand's support more than a
OL,14,Fdecade ago, before police began
OL,15,Finvestigating him - and in 2014 Burnham
OL,16,Fposted a supportive message on social
OL,17,Fmedia when the comedian was facing
OL,18,Fmedia criticism.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
