OL,3,ABurnham responds to BBC question over
OL,4,ALabour's links to Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked about the 2014 tweet on Friday,
OL,7,FBurnham said: "It's not always the case
OL,8,Fthat people know everything about
OL,9,Fpeople in public life."
OL,11,FBrand was found guilty of one count of
OL,12,Frape and three counts of sexual assault
OL,13,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
